# Copy to `.env` and fill in from: Supabase dashboard > Project Settings > API
#
# Both of these are PUBLIC by design — Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into
# the JS bundle, so treat them as visible to anyone who loads the page. That is
# fine here: this database revokes `anon` from every table, so the anon key on
# its own reads nothing at all. Access comes from signing in as an admin.
#
# Never put SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY in this file. It bypasses RLS entirely,
# and a VITE_ prefix would ship a full-database credential to the browser.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
